    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n36812" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐξαντλ-έω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>drain</i> or <i>draw off,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Lg.</u>
				736b
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>PTeb.</u>
				123.6
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(i B. C.)</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Aret.
				<u>SA</u>
				2.4
			</span></i>:—
				Pass.
			, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>HA</u>
				570a8
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> metaph.,
				<i>endure to the end, see out,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐκείνων μείζον᾽ ἐ. πόνον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					E.
					<u>Cyc.</u>
					10
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸν αὐτὸν δαίμον᾽ ἐ.
			ἐμοί</span> ib.<i><span class="en">
				110
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸν αὐτὸν ἐ. βίον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Fr.</u>
					454
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βίον οἰκτρὸν ἐ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Men.
					74
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">στρατῷ γόους</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					E.
					<u>Supp.</u>
					838
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<i>empty out,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Hld.
				1.3
			</span></i>; <i>squander,</i> [<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πλοῦτον</span>] <i><span class="en">
				Luc.
				<u>Tim.</u>
				18
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				17
			</span></i>(
				Pass.
			); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δύναμιν πόνοις</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Anach.</u>
					35
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Alciphr.
				1.21
			</span></i>.</div>
